  "notes": "Adds built-in AO3 image hosting. Local PNG, JPG/JPEG, and GIF images can now be uploaded directly from AO3 Skin Studio to Catbox.moe with one built-in action; the returned direct public URL is filled into the correct background, separate-header, or bottom-border URL field automatically and is then included in exported AO3 CSS. Includes per-image Upload for AO3 buttons plus Upload All Local Images for AO3. Uploads require an explicit public-upload confirmation and remain optional; manual direct URLs still work. Keeps the 0.1.63 tag-visibility and performance fixes."
